      <definition> T. byin gyis brlabs pa; S. adhishthita.Blessed, empowered.</definition>
      <page>1159</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠳᠢᠰᠲᠢᠳ ᠢ ᠠᠶᠢᠯᠠᠳᠬᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- i ailadxaxu;</transcript>
          <definition> T. byin rlabs gsol ba,’ byin rlabs zhu ba. To pray for a blessing.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠳᠢᠰᠲᠢᠳ ᠢ ᠥᠷᠦᠰᠢᠶᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- i orysijeky; </transcript>
          <definition>T. byin rlabs stsal ba, byin rlabs gtong ba. To give a blessing, grant a benediction.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
